1. Definitions

"Software" means this project’s source code, object code, documentation, and
other materials distributed under this license, and any copies or
modifications of them.

"AI Model" means a machine-learning or other artificial-intelligence model,
including a generative model, language model, embedding model, or a component
of such a model.

"AI Search Engine" means a search, retrieval, or question-answering system
that uses artificial intelligence, machine learning, semantic search,
embeddings, or retrieval-augmented generation to find, rank, summarize, or
answer questions about indexed material.

