   an AI Model; or

b. to populate, ingest into, crawl for, index, embed in, or otherwise add to
   an AI Search Engine or its search, retrieval, or reference corpus.

These restrictions apply whether the use is direct or through an intermediary,
and whether the Software is used in source, object, or another form.

4. AI-assisted software development

Section 3 does not prohibit using the Software as context or input to an AI
